.SS CVE\-2026\-63077
JetBrains TeamCity, added 2026\-08\-05, ransomware: Known.
.PP
JetBrains TeamCity Deserialization of Untrusted Data Vulnerability.
.PP
\fIHow it is exploited (CISA):\fR
JetBrains TeamCity contains a deserialization of untrusted data vulnerability that could allow unauthenticated remote code execution via the agent polling protocol.
.PP
\fIRemediation:\fR
Apply vendor mitigations; follow CISA BOD 26\-04 (risk\-based patching) and forensics triage. Discontinue use if no mitigation exists.
 Due 2026\-08\-08.
.PP
